 "about_text": "Heavy Manners Library is a lending library, gallery, and bookstore focused on artist-made and independently published media. It offers an alternative to costly formal art education by making self-published books, zines, and other overlooked or out-of-print materials accessible to the public. Members can borrow items with a library card, while visitors may browse the collection during open hours. Alongside its lending program, Heavy Manners hosts events and exhibitions in its gallery, theater, and classroom spaces, aiming to give emerging artists opportunities to share work and established artists room to experiment, with an emphasis on community-oriented educational programming.",
